sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant C as Client
  participant A as API
  participant D as Database

  U->>C: Opens app
  C->>A: GET /api/session
  A->>D: SELECT session
  D-->>A: session row
  alt valid session
    A-->>C: 200 { user }
    C-->>U: Show dashboard
  else expired
    A-->>C: 401
    C-->>U: Redirect to login
  end
